        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s1_1",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "Good Morning. Youth Council. Caroline speaking.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_2",
            "speaker": "ROGER",
            "text": "Oh, hello, I'm interested in standing for election to the Youth Council, and I was told to give you a call.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_3",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "That's good. Could you I have your name, please?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_4",
            "speaker": "ROGER",
            "text": "Yes, it's Roger Brown. (Example)",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_5",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "Thank you. I'm Caroline, the Youth Council administrator. So do you know much about what the Council does, Roger?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_6",
            "speaker": "ROGER",
            "text": "I've talked to Stephanie - I think she's the chair of the Council.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_7",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "That's right.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_8",
            "speaker": "ROGER",
            "text": "And she told me a lot about it. How it's a way for young people to discuss local issues, for example, and make suggestions to the town council. That's what made me interested.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_9",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "Fine. Well let me take down some of your details. First of all, how old are you? You know the Council is for young people aged from 13 to 18?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_10",
            "speaker": "ROGER",
            "text": "I've just turned 18.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s1_11",
            "speaker": "CAROLINE",
            "text": "And where do you live, Roger?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
